       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. L05.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-NAME PIC X(20).
       01 WS-COUNT PIC 9(5) VALUE ZERO.
       01 WS-AMOUNT PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
       01 WS-AMOUNT-EDIT PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           MOVE 12345 TO WS-COUNT
           MOVE 12345.67 TO WS-AMOUNT
           MOVE WS-AMOUNT TO WS-AMOUNT-EDIT
           DISPLAY "COUNT=" WS-COUNT
           DISPLAY "AMOUNT=" WS-AMOUNT-EDIT
           STOP RUN.
